dummy: Dummy tool for framework tests.
repo (owner/name) defaults to the detected repository. Modes: R read, W write, D destructive (needs confirm). * = required.
get [R] n* - show one
list [R] n - list all
create [W] body* labels draft - create one
remove [D] confirm - delete
boom [R] - panics
size [R] max_chars full - limits
newer [R] - needs 99
token [R] - echoes the token
help=<action> shows the full parameter list of one action.